### Empty Body

The behavior of `.json()` with an empty response body depends on whether a validation schema is provided.

#### Without a Schema

If no schema is provided, calling `.json()` on a response with an empty body (including `204 No Content` responses) will result in an error. This is because Ky attempts to parse the empty string as JSON, which is invalid.

```typescript
// source/core/Ky.ts:319-326
