				if (text === '') {
					if (schema !== undefined) {
						return validateJsonWithSchema(undefined, schema);
					}

					return JSON.parse(text);
				}
```
Calling `JSON.parse('')` at `source/core/Ky.ts:325` throws an error.

The documentation states:
> Also, `.json()` throws if the body is empty or the response status is `204`.
> `readme.md:119-120`

Tests confirm this behavior for both empty bodies and `204` responses:
